 hs (USD 100\,000 stipend plus USD 25\,000 project budget) to lead an indep
 endent project.\n\nOrganisation: Mozilla Foundation\nLocation: Internation
 al. Fellows lead independent projects\; the cohort meets at in-person gath
 erings.\nAward: Up to USD 125\,000 over 12 months: a USD 100\,000 stipend 
 plus a USD 25\,000 project budget. 10 Fellowships awarded. No application 
 fee stated.\nDuration: 12 months\, from 1 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.
 mozillafoundation.org/en/what-we-do/grantmaking/fellowship/2027-call-for-a
